{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_0_level_main_00-07_end","groupId":"main_0","stageId":"main_00-07","title":"感染","storyCode":"0-7","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_00-07_end.txt","sourceHash":"325b4d9c867fca53acee12126e6b1c463024fcfd5071063204728ca730704d37","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第四关（后）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_5"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"依照既定路線，我們已經很接近切城南邊的中城區了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"穿過這個公園，就是會合點。不出意外的話，臨光和E4小隊應該已經在那裡等著我們了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"可是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"要是臨光......被襲擊了，會怎麼樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"要是他們原本想用通訊設施警告我們，卻發現訊號遭到干擾......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"我們該怎麼辦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我們會去確認。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"......啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"我們要親眼確認事件之後，才會做出揣測。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"不要用懷疑恐嚇自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"明，明白了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"失去聯絡手段所帶來的恐慌情緒，比想像中蔓延得快得多......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"特別是......在這個天災仿佛近在眼前的時候。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"我們得趕緊加快速度了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"欸......這陣霧氣......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"——難道——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"小心！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"幹掉他們。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"敵軍的射擊！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"這是陷阱......！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"————！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"不好，我們的後方也出現了整合運動的追兵......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"偵查幹員呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"被戰場分割了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"追上你們了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"殺！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"這次，就讓你們粉身碎骨。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"杜賓！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"狙擊幹員！壓制敵人的衝鋒！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"重裝幹員，防禦姿態，隨時準備向前頂上！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"Ace，準備————"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"等一下，等一下——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"在清剿了東南要塞之後，我一聽到你的消息，可是立刻就趕過來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡已經是我的處理範圍囉，弑君者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"你來做什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"該把他們，交給我了吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["阿米婭"]},{"speakerId":"char_013_riop","aliases":["近衛幹員"]},{"speakerId":"char_014_riope","aliases":["Ace"]},{"speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","aliases":["整合運動成員"]},{"speakerId":"char_130_doberm","aliases":["杜賓"]},{"speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","aliases":["？？？","弑君者"]},{"speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","aliases":["？？？"]}]}
